  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Forteguerra filius Cacciaguidae de Forteguerriis locabo et concedo tibi abbati Ranerio abbatiae Sancti Salvatoris de Montis Amiata pratum meum positum in comitatu Senensi, iuxta fluvium Arbiae, cum iure aquae et pascendi, pro annuo censu librarum quinque feni boni et sicci, solvendo in festo Sancti Michaelis.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc locationem venire temptaverit, componat auri optimi libras quattuor, et haec carta firma permaneat in perpetuum.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Piccolominus filius Bernardi</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Malavoltus filius Ildebrandi</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ugurgerius filius Bonacursi</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ildebrandinus de Goriis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
  </text>
